# For Loop Assignment

This repository contains Java programs based on the For Loop concept.

## Programs

1. Odd Numbers
2. Even Numbers
3. Every Seventh Number
4. Increasing Star Pattern
5. Decreasing Star Pattern
6. Continuous Number Pattern
7. Number Triangle Pattern
8. Reverse Number Pattern

## Technologies Used

- Java
- Eclipse IDE

## Topics Covered

- for loop
- nested for loop
- if condition
- modulo operator
- pattern printing
- Console Input
